<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Tuesday 115,000-USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Tuesday 115,000-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Tuesday's est 115,000, Wk ago 118,000, and Yr ago 96,000 head. Estimates include generally about 60 percent Carcass Base Hogs. Barrows and gilts traded $1.00 lower than mid-session Monday. Trade was active for light demand and moderate to heavy offerings.</p>
<p>Top $52.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>				   Country		  Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs		    50.00 -51.00	   51.00 -52.00</p>
<p>few				49.50 -51.50	   50.50 -52.50</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>260-280 lbs		    48.00 -51.00	   48.50 -52.00</p>
<p>US 2-4   43-49% Carcass Base Lean</p>
<p>280-300 lbs		    44.50 -49.50	   45.00 -50.50</p>
<p>Sows - mostly steady/off $2.00. Top $50.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.	  40.00 -42.00	   41.00 -43.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.		   42.00 -45.00	   43.00 -45.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up		    45.00 -48.50	   46.00 -50.00</p>
